"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T19:30:12-07:00","id":858088,"title":"","content":"I just purchased Beast, its a fun and disurbing book. <br /> <br /> My first idea is an Akanim Tyrant that embodies a fear of clowns. His Lair is a Circus, with each tent a Chamber, filled with terror and wonder.<br /> <br /> This Characters Horror is a giant clown, with fang and knives in his pockets, who usually only killed Heroes, but prefers to force his prey to preform for an adience (a mirage).<br /> <br /> Purformances include juggling knives, parricapating in cruel pranks, tight rope walking, and being tossed in a charge with various monsters (mirages), and adult shows (the Beast tries to keep his horror from the adult stuff, he doesn't want a rep for being a perv, but he can't watch his horror 24-7, and that makes him nervous), depending on what the person fears the most. The purpose to make the victim feel afraid and powerless, by humiliating them before an audience, as well aa forcing them to preform dangerous shows they don't feel safe doing.<br /> <br /> Lair traits, are Echo and Mirage, and the Chambers are the Big Top (heart) and the Animal cages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}